wait 18
expect tick 3478
expect midi_out >49
tap PLAY
expect playing 0
# Start from the jack (clock from USB around it, not followed), at the tempo in store: the one followed last (2 ticks
# a ms)
midi USB F8
wait 10
midi USB F8
wait 10
midi TRS FA
expect playing 1
expect tick 2
# (after an FA its first pulse is tick 0: the clock, at the master's own rate here, waits for it on 39 and never
